51	25	When you complete a course, you can download a certificate for it: 1. Open the profile dropdown and select My Enrolled Courses. 2. Find the course. Completed courses show Status: Completed. 3. Click Evaluate course & download certificate. You will be asked to evaluate the course first, then your certificate downloads. If you have already evaluated the course, the button shows Download certificate instead. The certificate is only available once the course is completed.	[0.010648501,0.008848771,0.021923183,-0.087075435,0.055075224,0.016806932,-0.014495487,0.012362313,-0.037504185,0.013568063,0.003448745,-0.010217138,0.019678436,-0.0008528756,0.24295056,-0.013295057,-0.00010277324,0.0038125343,-0.0145470975,-0.01971859,0.0027478826,0.002517928,-0.036238603,-0.0292099,0.0141694965,-0.02025031,0.03535164,0.05509553,0.027066981,-0.008444806,-0.0072130663,0.02061418,-0.0021591105,0.00590311,-0.028752068,0.031800203,-0.005472142,0.016292097,-0.024010079,-0.004052324,-0.0018550418,0.034650512,0.012822275,-0.044559658,0.021844095,-0.020622376,-0.033602025,-0.02184353,-0.025439203,0.012831041,-0.0051168306,-0.01526958,-0.07346177,-0.41573003,0.0009506,-0.027216176,0.018761251,0.020372864,0.006320285,-0.009012871,-0.051869515,0.044423237,-0.038920525,-0.011081151,-0.0002809073,0.019157236,0.057207227,0.05639561,-0.02451208,0.003651745,0.04934989,0.055791624,0.008370929,-0.0019971738,0.016663956,-0.03745825,-0.0042702374,0.00034819325,-0.003159078,0.030040625,-0.03497427,-0.013991915,0.046554506,0.025245486,0.03271663,0.0013968685,-0.0146860005,0.0013643827,-0.025382917,0.0061777947,-0.0129385,0.011636765,-0.0054315473,0.0053247074,0.0032291533,-0.039148673,0.0043343487,0.0005371768,-0.017548043,-0.027161866,-0.038537674,0.0069239056,-0.035049893,-0.017158039,0.012047851,-0.021087019,-0.013829285,-0.01457021,0.0073274923,0.0019866675,-0.0072752708,-0.024976784,-0.03433263,0.025815537,0.027458182,-0.34786293,0.010945216,0.0056375843,0.02040057,-0.065992095,-0.02496377,-0.00